# Citation metadata for yuhan_das_spectra (GitHub version of check_minmag_pkg
# from the Zenodo archive v1.0.0).
# Licence note: the code is MIT, except functions/load_das_h5_PE2024.py
# (third-party code; see NOTICE) and the ERA5 CSVs in meteo/ (Copernicus terms).
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper (preferred-citation) and this software."
title: "yuhan_das_spectra"
abstract: >-
  Spectral analysis toolkit for seafloor Distributed Acoustic Sensing (DAS)
  data accompanying the paper "Persistent Faulting Activity Along the Kefalonia
  Transform Fault Revealed by Seafloor DAS": continuous noise PSD/PPSD,
  noise-weather/wave comparison with ERA5 reanalysis, 8-20 Hz noise trend
  extraction, and per-event earthquake spectral scaling (with minimum
  detectable magnitude Mc validation as one application). This repository is
  the standalone GitHub version of check_minmag_pkg from the Zenodo archive
  v1.0.0 (matched_filter_release.zip).
